  "fees kept by residents of the agent's country, against {n0}; see research/{n1}-{n2}/gaps/payment_channels-notes.md": "prowizje zatrzymane przez rezydentów kraju agenta, w porównaniu z {n0}; zob. research/{n1}-{n2}/gaps/payment_channels-notes.md",
